WEBVTT

01:49.940 --> 01:53.930
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.370 --> 01:56.670
[Episode 12]

02:01.280 --> 02:02.120
So,

02:02.170 --> 02:04.370
he only moved into the lane 2 months ago?

02:05.760 --> 02:06.350
Yes.

02:08.800 --> 02:11.860
So it's really related to
Lyman's Design Competition.

02:12.800 --> 02:14.060
It's related to Lyman?

02:14.560 --> 02:15.560
Two months ago,

02:15.710 --> 02:17.640
right when Lyman released the news

02:18.120 --> 02:19.850
about the Design Competition.

02:20.520 --> 02:22.780
He never does anything without purpose.

02:27.150 --> 02:28.190
Are you saying

02:28.280 --> 02:30.940
they are planning
a lane-style hotel this time?

02:30.960 --> 02:32.820
But the lane theme is nothing new.

02:32.840 --> 02:35.220
Traditional Jiangsu and Zhejiang buildings

02:35.220 --> 02:36.180
are everywhere.

02:36.870 --> 02:38.079
If he's doing this,

02:39.030 --> 02:41.030
there must be something I don't know

02:41.630 --> 02:43.960
that can increase his chances of winning.

02:44.840 --> 02:45.710
It's a pity...

02:46.400 --> 02:48.400
we don't have another Jiang Tianyi.

02:51.079 --> 02:51.590
No.

02:52.240 --> 02:53.710
I-I mean,

02:54.030 --> 02:56.230
the Design Competition is coming soon.

02:56.560 --> 02:57.680
Even if we knew

02:57.680 --> 02:58.870
what they are planning,

02:58.870 --> 02:59.670
it would be...

02:59.870 --> 03:00.870
Notify everyone.

03:01.110 --> 03:02.370
Meeting in 10 minutes.

03:05.520 --> 03:07.710
The building form
emphasizes vertical lines,

03:07.710 --> 03:09.120
with the top gradually receding inward,

03:09.120 --> 03:11.400
creating a tall and elegant presence.

03:11.590 --> 03:13.320
The design stresses symmetry,

03:13.510 --> 03:15.100
proportion, and scale,

03:15.190 --> 03:16.840
with a focus on luxurious decoration

03:16.840 --> 03:18.200
and a three-part composition

03:18.200 --> 03:20.200
in its architectural composition.

03:23.710 --> 03:24.430
Well,

03:24.840 --> 03:26.320
that concludes my presentation.

03:26.320 --> 03:26.950
Mr. Pei.

03:35.630 --> 03:36.190
Mr. Pei,

03:36.470 --> 03:37.190
do you think

03:37.190 --> 03:38.800
there is anything in our current proposal

03:38.800 --> 03:40.130
that needs adjustment?

03:45.150 --> 03:46.410
Let's leave it for now.

03:59.190 --> 03:59.710
Mr. Pei,

04:01.000 --> 04:02.400
you dismissed everyone.

04:02.840 --> 04:04.300
Do you already have a plan?

04:10.590 --> 04:12.250
Go arrange an interview for me

04:12.800 --> 04:14.530
within the next couple of days.

04:24.690 --> 04:26.880
[Incorporating Stone-Doorframe House Elements
from Shanghai Lanes]

04:28.920 --> 04:29.750
Come on, Hu,

04:30.370 --> 04:31.230
have a "drink."

04:32.470 --> 04:33.330
Thank you, Sun.

04:33.560 --> 04:35.159
Here, Zhuang. Hand these out to everyone.

04:35.159 --> 04:35.750
Thank you, Sun.

04:35.750 --> 04:37.390
-Thank you, Sun.
-Thank you, Sun.

04:37.390 --> 04:39.320
-You're welcome.
-Thank you, Sun.

04:39.480 --> 04:40.430
Everyone,

04:41.600 --> 04:42.680
once we get through tonight

04:42.680 --> 04:44.750
and confirm there
are no issues with the design,

04:44.750 --> 04:45.870
we can submit it.

04:45.870 --> 04:46.720
Hang in there.

04:46.830 --> 04:47.920
The holiday is just around the corner.

04:47.920 --> 04:48.950
Let's keep up the good work, shall we?

04:48.950 --> 04:50.560
Okay! Let's do it!

04:52.720 --> 04:54.720
Come here! Something bad happened!

05:06.270 --> 05:07.000
Who is this?

05:10.510 --> 05:11.700
What's going on?

05:12.040 --> 05:12.720
Ms. Zhou,

05:12.920 --> 05:13.630
Mr. Xiao.

05:16.750 --> 05:17.550
That's right.

05:17.680 --> 05:19.590
All the architects at Zhuling

05:19.950 --> 05:21.280
have a say in their work.

05:21.680 --> 05:23.040
In every project,

05:23.160 --> 05:25.360
I want them to be creators,

05:25.680 --> 05:27.070
not just

05:27.070 --> 05:28.750
a group of operators working to meet

05:28.750 --> 05:30.010
the client's demands.

05:30.040 --> 05:31.240
Speaking of clients,

05:31.430 --> 05:33.270
Zhuling and Yueheng have always maintained

05:33.270 --> 05:34.870
a good working relationship.

05:34.870 --> 05:36.920
I hear there's something new
coming up soon.

05:36.920 --> 05:37.630
Can you give us a hint

05:37.630 --> 05:39.360
in this exclusive interview?

05:40.270 --> 05:42.830
Yueheng Group and Zhuling are old friends.

05:43.510 --> 05:45.560
We've collaborated
on quite a few projects,

05:45.560 --> 05:47.360
mostly in a modern style.

05:47.510 --> 05:49.720
But this time, we are planning a hotel project

05:49.720 --> 05:52.310
featuring Shanghai cultural elements.

05:52.830 --> 05:54.490
Can you be a bit more specific?

05:54.610 --> 05:56.070
That's a business secret.

05:57.270 --> 05:58.070
Just kidding.

05:58.200 --> 05:59.640
What I can say for now

05:59.690 --> 06:01.710
is that we'll use Shanghai's
stone-doorframe houses

06:01.710 --> 06:03.240
as the main design element.

06:03.430 --> 06:04.630
My father and I...

06:05.060 --> 06:05.660
Mr. Xiao,

06:05.690 --> 06:07.610
isn't this similar to our idea?

06:08.110 --> 06:08.720
Exactly.

06:09.000 --> 06:10.800
Why did Zhuling suddenly come up

06:10.830 --> 06:11.720
with this?

06:14.630 --> 06:15.070
Mr. Xiao.

06:15.070 --> 06:16.270
Let's have a meeting.

06:16.630 --> 06:18.830
Let's hear everyone's thoughts first.

06:37.190 --> 06:37.800
Mr. Xiao,

06:38.000 --> 06:38.630
Ms. Zhou,

06:39.260 --> 06:40.920
let me share my opinion first.

06:41.830 --> 06:43.240
I have full confidence

06:43.240 --> 06:44.480
in our design.

06:44.990 --> 06:46.750
Even if we're using the same elements,

06:46.750 --> 06:49.150
our plan will definitely outshine theirs.

06:50.000 --> 06:51.120
As for

06:51.420 --> 06:53.190
changing our plan at the last minute,

06:53.190 --> 06:54.510
quality aside,

06:54.720 --> 06:57.180
whether we can finish it in time is already a question.

06:57.180 --> 06:57.890
Yifei,

06:58.750 --> 07:00.520
even the most secret project

07:00.660 --> 07:02.660
can't stay completely under wraps.

07:03.390 --> 07:05.310
When have you ever heard
that Yueheng Group

07:05.310 --> 07:06.270
is developing

07:06.270 --> 07:08.270
a Shanghai-cultural themed hotel?

07:09.390 --> 07:11.050
If we were at the competition—

07:11.190 --> 07:12.590
never mind just Zhuling—

07:12.830 --> 07:14.510
even if all the companies presented proposals

07:14.510 --> 07:15.630
with stone-doorframe house elements,

07:15.630 --> 07:17.430
we wouldn't be afraid
of direct competition.

07:17.430 --> 07:18.750
But the problem now

07:19.270 --> 07:20.600
is that right before the competition,

07:20.600 --> 07:21.920
Zhuling suddenly claimed

07:21.920 --> 07:23.040
to be preparing

07:23.170 --> 07:24.430
this so-called special project,

07:24.430 --> 07:25.270
and they even emphasized

07:25.270 --> 07:27.470
that it would be implemented very soon.

07:27.730 --> 07:28.320
That means

07:28.320 --> 07:30.120
no matter how good our proposal is

07:30.120 --> 07:32.120
or how competitive the details are,

07:32.380 --> 07:34.020
Lyman won't buy it.

07:34.680 --> 07:36.040
Because in their eyes,

07:36.270 --> 07:38.870
no matter how we design this lane-style hotel,

07:38.920 --> 07:41.320
we'll just be copying someone else's idea.

07:43.120 --> 07:45.000
So this project mentioned in the interview

07:45.000 --> 07:46.800
won't actually be implemented.

07:47.240 --> 07:49.140
Whether it'll be implemented or not,

07:49.140 --> 07:51.670
the impact has already
fallen squarely on us.

07:59.600 --> 08:01.600
Thank you for your hard work overtime lately.

08:01.600 --> 08:03.000
Go back and get some rest.

08:03.150 --> 08:04.280
Meeting adjourned.

08:32.360 --> 08:33.750
The scallions have grown.

08:33.750 --> 08:35.610
Come back and eat Yanduxian soup.

08:36.070 --> 08:38.000
Those flowers seem beyond saving.

08:38.340 --> 08:39.929
Could you buy some plant nutrients?

08:39.929 --> 08:40.809
It's urgent.

08:51.360 --> 08:52.080
Mr. Xiao,

08:52.150 --> 08:53.950
now you really have to come back.

08:54.320 --> 08:56.060
Do you remember the old lady
who sells hydrogen balloons

08:56.060 --> 08:57.200
at the lane entrance?

08:57.200 --> 08:59.750
She wasn't paying attention today and all the balloons flew off

08:59.750 --> 09:01.390
and got stuck on our roof.

09:02.030 --> 09:04.360
I have to climb up
through the skylight in your room

09:04.360 --> 09:05.760
to help her get them down.

09:13.270 --> 09:14.980
When are you coming back?

09:15.110 --> 09:16.750
She's worried sick.

09:39.440 --> 09:40.240
You lied to me?

09:41.510 --> 09:43.170
If I hadn't pulled this trick,

09:43.200 --> 09:44.550
you could've stayed gone

09:44.550 --> 09:46.270
until the Lyman competition.

09:48.480 --> 09:50.140
If I hadn't pulled this trick,

09:50.490 --> 09:53.950
you'd probably lie in your room until the Design Competition.

10:01.550 --> 10:02.160
Stop.

10:03.270 --> 10:05.310
The plant nutrients part
might be an excuse,

10:05.310 --> 10:06.830
but there really is an old lady who's been waiting for you

10:06.830 --> 10:07.590
to come home.

10:08.110 --> 10:08.790
Cut it out.

10:09.680 --> 10:11.790
If you don't believe me,
go up and see for yourself.

10:11.790 --> 10:12.720
Go by yourself.

10:13.070 --> 10:15.270
The door upstairs isn't locked anyway.

10:16.070 --> 10:16.640
Fine.

10:26.590 --> 10:28.390
I thought you didn't believe me.

10:29.910 --> 10:31.510
I was afraid you'd bring something weird

10:31.510 --> 10:32.390
into my room again.

10:32.390 --> 10:34.450
That doll last time was scary enough.

10:44.910 --> 10:45.630
Be careful.

10:46.390 --> 10:48.320
It's fine. I'm quite experienced.

10:52.550 --> 10:53.320
Come up.

11:00.840 --> 11:01.630
I had no choice.

11:01.630 --> 11:02.890
Seeing how upset the old lady was,

11:02.890 --> 11:04.350
I bought all her balloons.

11:05.680 --> 11:06.940
I didn't lock the door.

11:07.580 --> 11:09.310
I didn't feel right barging in.

11:09.510 --> 11:11.320
Didn't someone lock themselves

11:11.320 --> 11:13.250
in the attic to keep me away before?

11:19.960 --> 11:20.600
See?

11:21.030 --> 11:22.310
I rarely lie.

11:25.930 --> 11:27.330
Where are the scallions?

11:30.790 --> 11:31.480
Mr. Xiao,

11:31.570 --> 11:34.430
authentic Yanduxian soup doesn't need scallions.

11:36.150 --> 11:37.700
Uncle Wang gave this to me.

11:37.930 --> 11:39.390
I traded scallions for it.

11:41.910 --> 11:43.250
Uncle Wang is that generous?

11:43.250 --> 11:45.650
You got this from him
with just some scallions?

11:45.650 --> 11:46.910
You don't understand.

11:47.510 --> 11:49.440
Scallions are cheap at the market,

11:49.550 --> 11:51.120
but once the dish is cooking

11:51.120 --> 11:53.000
and you're just missing that little bit of it,

11:53.000 --> 11:54.200
it's worth a fortune.

11:56.650 --> 11:58.780
Is this how you always find loopholes?

11:58.960 --> 11:59.620
Otherwise,

11:59.690 --> 12:01.420
how could you be drinking this?

12:21.810 --> 12:23.070
Your friend moved out,

12:23.580 --> 12:25.110
and your parents moved out.

12:25.480 --> 12:26.740
Why are you still here?

12:30.270 --> 12:31.240
Because...

12:32.870 --> 12:33.800
it's different.

12:35.030 --> 12:37.960
This place is nothing like
those new buildings

12:38.510 --> 12:39.370
or apartments.

12:41.510 --> 12:42.600
It's old,

12:43.320 --> 12:44.720
but that's exactly

12:44.860 --> 12:46.670
why the lanes

12:46.690 --> 12:48.840
have a sense of story

12:50.040 --> 12:51.370
and a legendary quality

12:51.440 --> 12:52.390
that

12:52.990 --> 12:54.190
new buildings don't.

12:59.550 --> 13:00.550
That second floor

13:01.000 --> 13:02.660
used to be Granny Wang's home.

13:03.640 --> 13:05.570
I always think she is the most exquisite

13:05.570 --> 13:07.430
and elegant person I've ever met.

13:07.750 --> 13:08.390
I heard she was a noble lady

13:08.390 --> 13:10.250
during the Republic of China era.

13:13.790 --> 13:15.840
I once saw her old photos.

13:16.120 --> 13:18.120
She was stunning when she was young.

13:23.300 --> 13:25.380
If you turn into the lane next to us,

13:25.630 --> 13:26.590
at the very end,

13:26.910 --> 13:29.600
you'll see Mr. Wang's secret hideout from when he was a kid.

13:29.600 --> 13:30.630
He told me

13:30.750 --> 13:32.150
his parents worked in a factory

13:32.150 --> 13:33.630
and didn't have time to take care of him.

13:33.630 --> 13:35.890
That place used to be his little canteen.

13:43.150 --> 13:45.080
And Dazhong.

13:45.590 --> 13:47.960
Dazhong was amazing at the violin.

13:47.960 --> 13:49.690
He even won awards in Shanghai.

13:49.820 --> 13:51.950
You wouldn't have guessed, would you?

13:57.320 --> 13:57.960
Of course,

13:57.960 --> 14:00.480
living in the lanes
has many inconveniences.

14:00.480 --> 14:02.270
The spaces are cramped,

14:02.480 --> 14:03.630
the soundproofing is poor,

14:03.630 --> 14:05.490
and the facilities are outdated.

14:05.560 --> 14:06.870
You don't even need to mention these—

14:06.870 --> 14:08.400
young people don't like it.

14:08.600 --> 14:10.530
Older people with mobility issues

14:10.550 --> 14:11.960
who rely on elevators

14:11.960 --> 14:14.020
aren't suitable to live here either.

14:14.550 --> 14:15.390
Like my dad.

14:19.900 --> 14:20.660
Indeed.

14:22.750 --> 14:24.200
If only there was a building

14:24.200 --> 14:26.660
that could preserve the history of the lanes

14:27.030 --> 14:29.120
while fixing

14:29.240 --> 14:30.310
all these

14:30.990 --> 14:31.990
inconveniences.

14:34.740 --> 14:36.500
How can anything be so perfect?

14:40.750 --> 14:41.440
Alright.

14:41.440 --> 14:42.750
You've had your soup

14:43.030 --> 14:44.230
and got the balloons.

14:44.770 --> 14:46.700
Mr. Xiao, you should get some rest.

14:49.910 --> 14:51.360
We still have time.

14:52.400 --> 14:53.630
Don't give up.

14:59.200 --> 15:00.750
Who told you I was giving up?

15:02.870 --> 15:03.600
Well...

15:04.320 --> 15:05.580
I misunderstood then.

15:07.650 --> 15:11.950
♪ Under the streetlight,
I grow increasingly weary ♪

15:08.960 --> 15:09.490
Alright.

15:10.040 --> 15:10.870
You go down.

15:11.510 --> 15:12.970
I'll sit here a bit longer.

15:14.100 --> 15:18.940
♪ A few specks of dust
drift by in the wind ♪

15:17.870 --> 15:19.130
What are you going to do

15:19.390 --> 15:20.790
with all those balloons?

15:21.040 --> 15:25.200
♪ The girl who once
basked in the sunlight ♪

15:25.870 --> 15:27.200
I want that one! I want that one!

15:26.060 --> 15:28.980
♪ Where did she go to play? ♪

15:27.200 --> 15:28.240
I want that one!

15:28.240 --> 15:29.000
Which one? You go first.

15:29.000 --> 15:30.550
The transparent one! The transparent one!

15:29.420 --> 15:32.390
♪ I don't understand either ♪

15:30.550 --> 15:32.280
I want that one! I want that one!

15:32.390 --> 15:33.030
Which one?

15:33.870 --> 15:35.360
This one, right?

15:34.310 --> 15:38.570
♪ Scrolling on lines we once said before ♪

15:36.000 --> 15:37.000
This blue one?

15:37.000 --> 15:37.840
The octopus?

15:37.960 --> 15:38.840
Here you go.

15:39.790 --> 15:41.030
They're tangled. Wait a sec.

15:41.030 --> 15:41.960
Here, take these three first.

15:41.060 --> 15:45.080
♪ Echo replied just a second too slow ♪

15:41.960 --> 15:42.790
-Thank you.
-What about you?

15:42.790 --> 15:43.840
I want that one.

15:43.840 --> 15:44.910
The transparent one.

15:44.910 --> 15:45.750
The fuzzy one.

15:45.750 --> 15:47.320
This fuzzy one, right?

15:46.340 --> 15:49.090
♪ At the edge of the road ♪

15:47.320 --> 15:49.050
I want that one! I want that one!

15:49.120 --> 15:52.310
♪ In the crowd in the night ♪

15:50.440 --> 15:51.640
Which one do you want?

15:54.190 --> 16:00.170
♪ Who hasn't paid the price
and still fell down? ♪

16:01.300 --> 16:05.060
♪ Stand with me tonight,
look at the starlight ♪

16:06.270 --> 16:11.930
♪ Even when I fell absurd like a stage ♪

16:13.260 --> 16:18.440
♪ Every step feels so hard ♪

16:19.970 --> 16:23.700
♪ But in this world
there's always someone ♪

16:24.110 --> 16:28.940
♪ Who starts again, just like I do ♪

16:27.910 --> 16:28.670
Mr. Xiao,

16:28.840 --> 16:30.440
what are you thinking about?

16:33.150 --> 16:34.030
I'm thinking

16:34.910 --> 16:36.570
that looking at this lane now,

16:36.910 --> 16:38.360
it feels like I could step right into

16:38.360 --> 16:39.890
all those stories you told,

16:40.840 --> 16:42.970
as if I now possess those memories too.

16:45.630 --> 16:46.320
Yes.

16:46.550 --> 16:49.200
Maybe the kids
who got these balloons today

16:49.400 --> 16:51.320
will still remember those balloons

16:51.320 --> 16:53.630
from this morning 10 or 20 years from now.

16:55.680 --> 16:57.940
Then we'll become part of their stories.

17:02.480 --> 17:03.030
Let's go.

17:03.270 --> 17:04.530
Let's go to the office.

17:08.510 --> 17:09.510
Coming!

17:12.160 --> 17:12.880
I almost forgot

17:12.880 --> 17:14.829
it's Saturday and everyone's off today.

17:14.829 --> 17:16.030
Should I send them a message,

17:16.030 --> 17:17.329
telling them to come as soon as they see it?

17:17.329 --> 17:19.859
Forget it. Let's sort out
our thoughts first.

17:23.569 --> 17:29.430
♪ Life lays out the outline of my scenes ♪

17:25.640 --> 17:26.510
Sun?

17:27.240 --> 17:27.680
Why are you here?

17:27.680 --> 17:28.240
Mr. Xiao.

17:29.260 --> 17:30.060
Are you okay?

17:30.640 --> 17:32.510
I had too much Sichuan food last night.

17:30.670 --> 17:34.140
♪ The last act
was a monologue in a dream ♪

17:32.510 --> 17:34.110
My stomach is still burning.

17:34.640 --> 17:35.960
But if I don't finish the work,

17:35.340 --> 17:39.110
♪ And in the next,
I wander through the city's noise ♪

17:35.960 --> 17:37.720
I can't rest easy.

17:38.830 --> 17:40.000
I have some stomach medicine here.

17:40.000 --> 17:40.920
Take some. You'll feel better.

17:40.270 --> 17:43.340
♪ So many arrivals
that turned out to be nothing ♪

17:41.550 --> 17:43.400
After you finish your work, go home early.

17:43.400 --> 17:44.530
Thank you, Mr. Xiao.

17:44.920 --> 17:48.570
♪ I'm counting the beats of the clock ♪

17:46.680 --> 17:48.010
Good morning, Mr. Xiao.

17:49.630 --> 17:53.430
♪ I can't tell which platform
is for leaving or returning ♪

17:50.750 --> 17:51.440
Sun.

17:52.680 --> 17:53.830
You didn't take us with you when working overtime.

17:53.830 --> 17:54.920
That's not cool.

17:54.300 --> 17:58.570
♪ Until you walk toward me ♪

17:55.680 --> 17:56.590
You're here too?

17:56.590 --> 17:56.960
Yes.

17:56.960 --> 17:58.420
The work wasn't finished.

17:58.440 --> 18:00.110
For this project, let's work together.

18:00.000 --> 18:03.580
♪ And my breath softens ♪

18:01.200 --> 18:02.200
Morning, Mr. Xiao.

18:02.200 --> 18:03.260
Morning, Mr. Xiao.

18:05.100 --> 18:09.480
♪ I forget every absurd line ♪

18:07.070 --> 18:09.200
Looks like I didn't buy enough coffee.

18:10.250 --> 18:14.230
♪ Because of you ♪

18:15.070 --> 18:21.900
♪ Every pose looks so ridiculous
and helpless ♪

18:24.250 --> 18:29.450
♪ And fall into
this anticipation called "you" ♪

18:29.480 --> 18:34.200
♪ Because of you ♪

18:34.220 --> 18:40.990
♪ So you're beside the story
written by fate ♪

18:43.530 --> 18:44.980
♪ Oh, ok ♪

18:45.980 --> 18:47.690
♪ Oh, okay ♪

18:48.000 --> 18:49.910
♪ Oh, okay ♪

18:50.300 --> 18:52.300
♪ Oh, okay ♪

18:52.650 --> 18:55.760
♪ Oh, okay, my love ♪

18:56.750 --> 19:00.610
♪ It turns out you're my exception ♪

19:06.830 --> 19:08.510
[Lyman Group, Shanghai Hotel Community]

19:21.350 --> 19:22.580
[D Design Studio]

19:22.600 --> 19:24.170
[Zhuling Group]

19:27.270 --> 19:28.080
Mr. Zhu.

19:28.920 --> 19:29.640
Mr. Pei.

19:29.640 --> 19:30.270
Nice to meet you.

19:30.270 --> 19:30.830
Long time no see.

19:30.830 --> 19:31.760
Nice to meet you.

19:31.880 --> 19:33.030
Your father has been abroad
for a long time.

19:33.030 --> 19:34.590
I wonder when he'll be back.

19:34.820 --> 19:37.480
I hope he'll give us the pleasure of meeting him.

19:37.640 --> 19:38.640
My father

19:38.800 --> 19:39.870
has always been in poor health

19:39.870 --> 19:41.110
and is recuperating abroad.

19:41.110 --> 19:42.440
Once he makes up his mind and comes back,

19:42.440 --> 19:44.020
I'll host, and you'll have to honor us
with your presence.

19:44.020 --> 19:44.950
You're too kind.

19:47.890 --> 19:49.020
Mr. Xie has arrived.

19:50.100 --> 19:50.960
You came early.

19:51.310 --> 19:52.270
How are the preparations?

19:52.270 --> 19:53.420
Everything's ready.

19:53.420 --> 19:53.880
Mr. Xie.

19:54.200 --> 19:54.960
You're here.

19:55.400 --> 19:55.880
Okay.

19:56.030 --> 19:56.510
Come in.

19:58.400 --> 19:59.160
Uncle Xie,

19:59.550 --> 20:00.280
you're here.

20:00.480 --> 20:05.270
[Shanghai Hotel Community Design Competition]

20:01.810 --> 20:03.290
You look confident.

20:03.720 --> 20:04.320
Of course.

20:04.750 --> 20:05.830
By the way, Uncle Xie,

20:05.830 --> 20:07.830
Zhuling has recently started
a new project—

20:07.830 --> 20:08.790
a hotel design based on Shanghai's

20:08.790 --> 20:10.240
stone-doorframe houses.

20:10.240 --> 20:11.790
We'll have to ask for your presence by then.

20:11.790 --> 20:12.920
Certainly.

20:13.510 --> 20:15.030
I'll be looking forward to it.

20:15.030 --> 20:16.230
Thank you, Uncle Xie.

20:16.920 --> 20:17.510
Mr. Xie,

20:17.680 --> 20:18.880
the time is almost up.

20:19.310 --> 20:21.320
Have all the competing companies arrived?

20:21.320 --> 20:22.720
Only D Design Studio isn't here.

20:22.720 --> 20:23.650
What's going on?

20:24.110 --> 20:25.550
I just heard a rumor that

20:25.550 --> 20:27.550
D Design Studio didn't dare to come.

20:44.980 --> 20:47.580
♪ I wanted you to see the light ♪

20:49.250 --> 20:51.620
♪ But you tried to shut it down ♪

20:50.400 --> 20:51.510
It's about time.

20:51.680 --> 20:52.440
Please take your seats.

20:51.700 --> 20:54.510
♪ That night ♪

20:55.160 --> 21:01.600
♪ I'm stronger than I used to be ♪

21:02.650 --> 21:06.020
♪ Now watch me fight ♪

21:06.150 --> 21:11.370
♪ Oh, I'm done pretending ♪

21:11.390 --> 21:13.150
♪ And I ♪

21:11.960 --> 21:13.640
Distinguished guests
and leaders, thank you

21:13.350 --> 21:15.950
♪ I'm ready, I won't hide ♪

21:13.640 --> 21:15.110
for coming to Lyman Company

21:15.110 --> 21:17.310
to participate in the solicitation
of proposals for this project.

21:15.980 --> 21:18.480
♪ Now it's my turn ♪

21:17.680 --> 21:19.240
The submission period has now ended.

21:19.120 --> 21:21.980
♪ The reality is boring ♪

21:19.440 --> 21:20.480
I hereby announce

21:20.640 --> 21:22.880
that the Design Competition officially begins.

21:22.010 --> 21:25.330
♪ Following all the rules ♪

21:25.740 --> 21:29.420
♪ Then I'll take my time to handle it ♪

21:27.110 --> 21:27.880
Our hotel

21:27.880 --> 21:29.750
adopts the concept
of a floating community.

21:29.750 --> 21:30.400
As you can see,

21:30.160 --> 21:32.380
♪ I'm free ♪

21:30.590 --> 21:32.840
with the buoyancy of water, our building…

21:32.840 --> 21:35.840
♪ I fall into the abyss ♪

21:36.620 --> 21:40.030
♪ To the other side of logic ♪

21:43.020 --> 21:45.140
♪ Laid bare ♪

21:46.730 --> 21:50.860
♪ Yesterday all withers now ♪

21:51.470 --> 21:53.680
♪ I hear ♪

21:54.590 --> 21:57.290
♪ The war drums throbbing in my breast ♪

21:57.600 --> 22:04.070
♪ Submerged in tempests of fantasy ♪

22:03.460 --> 22:04.400
Finally,

22:04.510 --> 22:06.400
the biggest highlight of this design.

22:04.850 --> 22:07.010
♪ Now it's my turn ♪

22:07.040 --> 22:08.300
Within the community,

22:08.400 --> 22:09.400
we will have

22:08.450 --> 22:10.530
♪ Even if fate ♪

22:09.400 --> 22:10.270
a smart hub,

22:10.920 --> 22:12.240
a core system integrating

22:11.100 --> 22:13.770
♪ Cycles on and on ♪

22:12.510 --> 22:14.110
artificial intelligence management,

22:14.110 --> 22:15.830
data analysis,

22:14.970 --> 22:18.800
♪ How many tales tomorrow will spawn ♪

22:15.830 --> 22:17.070
and energy regulation.

22:17.070 --> 22:17.730
Technology

22:18.240 --> 22:19.310
can change the future.

22:19.140 --> 22:21.550
♪ I'm free ♪

22:19.590 --> 22:20.350
Shanghai

22:20.720 --> 22:21.640
is the future.

22:21.750 --> 22:24.750
♪ Winner still unknown ♪

22:22.160 --> 22:23.680
That concludes my presentation.

22:23.680 --> 22:24.400
Thank you.

22:25.660 --> 22:29.180
♪ I'll be the one writing my own story ♪

22:31.550 --> 22:34.440
Thank you to Zhuling Group for this wonderful proposal.

22:34.440 --> 22:36.310
Next, let's welcome Mr. Xiao Zhiyu

22:36.310 --> 22:37.510
from D Design Studio.

22:37.550 --> 22:39.150
A round of applause, please.

22:52.300 --> 22:53.000
Hello everyone,

22:53.000 --> 22:54.660
I'm Xiao Zhiyu from Dynamism.

22:55.790 --> 22:56.720
To put it simply,

22:56.920 --> 22:59.110
the concept of the proposal
I'm about to present

22:59.110 --> 23:00.260
originates from

23:00.280 --> 23:02.080
stone-doorframe house lanes.

23:13.240 --> 23:14.590
However, I'm not using

23:14.590 --> 23:17.050
the stone-doorframe house lane aesthetic.

23:17.880 --> 23:19.100
When thinking of lanes,

23:19.100 --> 23:21.130
people often first imagine buildings

23:21.130 --> 23:23.270
that blend Eastern and Western elements,

23:23.270 --> 23:24.710
shared living spaces,

23:24.920 --> 23:27.230
and the neighborhood warmth that grows from them.

23:27.230 --> 23:28.400
Many also think

23:28.460 --> 23:29.330
lanes

23:29.590 --> 23:30.440
are too cramped,

23:30.440 --> 23:31.070
too old,

23:31.460 --> 23:32.900
and inconvenient to live in.

23:32.900 --> 23:34.480
I once wondered about this too.

23:34.480 --> 23:35.400
Today's young people

23:35.400 --> 23:38.030
are used to smart,
convenient modern apartments.

23:38.030 --> 23:39.270
So why do some

23:39.270 --> 23:40.960
still choose to live in lanes?

23:41.750 --> 23:43.050
To find out the reasons,

23:43.050 --> 23:44.510
I moved into a lane myself.

23:45.440 --> 23:46.880
This experience became

23:46.880 --> 23:48.680
a very important part of my life,

23:49.350 --> 23:50.750
and I treasure it deeply.

23:51.630 --> 23:53.560
Beyond the richness of daily life,

23:54.140 --> 23:55.800
a certain resident in the lane

23:56.270 --> 23:58.130
also gave me a lot of inspiration.

24:00.180 --> 24:01.840
She helped me find the answer.

24:08.350 --> 24:09.160
Lanes carry

24:09.160 --> 24:11.170
the collective memory of old Shanghai residents.

24:11.170 --> 24:13.640
They possess
not only architectural beauty,

24:13.640 --> 24:15.440
but also a unique community life

24:15.440 --> 24:17.030
that formed over a century ago.

24:17.030 --> 24:18.430
Amid the bustling lanes,

24:19.880 --> 24:21.660
surrounding buildings are renovated and rebuilt,

24:20.010 --> 24:23.600
♪ Wind stops between
the corners of a rebooted street ♪

24:21.880 --> 24:23.400
but the memories unique to the lanes

24:23.400 --> 24:24.550
have never faded.

24:24.080 --> 24:27.830
♪ I see the foreshadowing of fate ♪

24:26.590 --> 24:28.700
We can create a new Lyman community

24:28.340 --> 24:31.970
♪ In that moment,
the world freezes in place ♪

24:29.270 --> 24:31.350
as a flowing city of time.

24:31.790 --> 24:33.030
Once you step into it,

24:32.210 --> 24:35.060
♪ Like flickering frames in a game ♪

24:33.240 --> 24:35.570
it's like opening the flow of time itself.

24:36.580 --> 24:38.000
♪ Opening the drifting dust ♪

24:36.880 --> 24:37.640
The waterfront lanes

24:37.640 --> 24:39.680
can connect neighborhoods from different eras,

24:38.030 --> 24:40.310
♪ You smile like light—so unexpected ♪

24:40.340 --> 24:42.150
♪ I hear our hearts matching ♪

24:40.640 --> 24:41.750
and VR technology

24:41.910 --> 24:43.880
will become the medium
for traveling through time.

24:42.180 --> 24:44.260
♪ In the collapse of this era ♪

24:44.010 --> 24:45.440
Whether you're in the restaurant,

24:44.900 --> 24:47.030
♪ Maybe I'll wake up ♪

24:45.550 --> 24:46.210
the garden,

24:46.310 --> 24:47.480
or on the community streets,

24:47.050 --> 24:48.740
♪ Maybe I shouldn't ♪

24:47.830 --> 24:49.090
just by putting on the glasses,

24:49.090 --> 24:52.270
♪ But the blank space in your eyes ♪

24:49.200 --> 24:50.750
you can be fully immersed

24:51.160 --> 24:53.030
and transported to different times.

24:52.300 --> 24:54.120
♪ Time and space howl ♪

24:54.030 --> 24:55.590
Those nostalgic times

24:54.170 --> 24:57.040
♪ Crossing paths of destiny ♪

24:55.830 --> 24:56.720
will be revealed

24:56.720 --> 24:57.590
through the architecture.

24:57.070 --> 24:58.910
♪ Dreams overturn ♪

24:58.880 --> 25:00.030
People who have left the lanes

24:58.970 --> 25:02.390
♪ With you,
I don't want to run away at all ♪

25:00.400 --> 25:01.920
can rediscover their past

25:02.070 --> 25:03.510
and find where they come from.

25:02.440 --> 25:03.300
♪ This heart of mine ♪

25:03.320 --> 25:05.140
♪ Falls for you over and over ♪

25:04.960 --> 25:06.880
And those
who have never stepped into a lane

25:05.200 --> 25:07.040
♪ Shattered, pieced together ♪

25:07.070 --> 25:09.930
♪ At least I once shone ♪

25:07.160 --> 25:08.240
can also feel

25:08.240 --> 25:11.070
the stories and legends that once happened here.

25:11.510 --> 25:13.640
Everyone can choose living areas
from different eras

25:13.640 --> 25:15.750
according to their preference

25:14.170 --> 25:17.880
♪ Night flows beyond the absurd neon ♪

25:16.190 --> 25:17.550
and immerse themselves

25:17.960 --> 25:20.310
in the unique Shanghai charm of each historical period.

25:18.520 --> 25:21.730
♪ Love becomes an unknown arrangement ♪

25:20.310 --> 25:21.640
It's truly impressive.

25:22.030 --> 25:24.510
To think of integrating time
and architecture—

25:22.340 --> 25:26.280
♪ The story is too willful and gentle ♪

25:24.830 --> 25:25.880
very creative.

25:26.400 --> 25:28.400
Design without a budget is just nonsense.

25:26.590 --> 25:30.580
♪ In my arms, it keeps changing ♪

25:28.510 --> 25:30.200
This budget is a lot higher than Zhuling's.

25:30.200 --> 25:31.400
The Lyman Resort Community

25:31.080 --> 25:32.640
♪ We're small ♪

25:31.400 --> 25:34.160
is a cultural space
that feels like traveling through time.

25:32.660 --> 25:34.660
♪ But we meet in the universe ♪

25:34.590 --> 25:35.720
People can continuously

25:34.690 --> 25:36.660
♪ This unreal script ♪

25:35.720 --> 25:37.590
create new memories and new stories

25:36.710 --> 25:38.710
♪ Somehow awakens me a little ♪

25:38.000 --> 25:40.070
in a community that blends tradition

25:38.730 --> 25:41.480
♪ Maybe I will wake up ♪

25:40.680 --> 25:42.000
with the present.

25:41.510 --> 25:43.510
♪ Maybe I shouldn't ♪

25:43.530 --> 25:46.660
♪ Yet I can't leave when turning away ♪

25:44.240 --> 25:44.750
That concludes

25:44.750 --> 25:45.200
Dynamism's

25:45.200 --> 25:46.350
presentation.

25:46.690 --> 25:48.590
♪ Time and space roar ♪

25:46.880 --> 25:48.480
Thank you all for listening.

25:48.780 --> 25:51.260
♪ Flying across heaven and earth
to hold you close ♪

25:51.280 --> 25:53.280
♪ Illusions topple ♪

25:53.300 --> 25:56.730
♪ I can hold your hands tight ♪

25:54.650 --> 25:55.970
[Key Project Members:
Senior Designer Sun Yifei]

25:55.970 --> 25:56.630
[Mid-level Designers
Tan Siyu and Xue Jiajia]

25:56.630 --> 25:57.300
[Assistant Designers
Hu Xiu and Zhang Ying]

25:56.760 --> 25:58.070
♪ My madness ♪

25:58.100 --> 25:59.690
♪ Spins for you until the break of dawn ♪

25:59.710 --> 26:01.710
♪ This moment ♪

26:02.370 --> 26:07.870
♪ Is real and shining ♪

26:12.000 --> 26:12.480
Thank you

26:12.480 --> 26:13.160
to Mr. Xiao Zhiyu

26:13.160 --> 26:15.510
from Dynamism
for his excellent presentation.

26:15.510 --> 26:16.510
I hereby announce

26:16.680 --> 26:19.000
that the presentation phase of this design competition

26:19.000 --> 26:19.930
is now complete.

26:20.000 --> 26:22.510
Next, I invite all the judges
to the conference hall

26:22.510 --> 26:23.960
for the final evaluation.

26:23.960 --> 26:24.920
Thank you.

26:26.240 --> 26:27.680
Skyline Studio.

26:28.200 --> 26:29.070
Please come in.

26:29.070 --> 26:29.880
The judges have some questions

26:29.880 --> 26:31.340
they'd like you to answer.

26:34.030 --> 26:34.510
Mr. Wu.

26:34.510 --> 26:35.750
Sorry to keep you waiting. Please.

26:35.750 --> 26:36.440
Here's the thing.

26:36.440 --> 26:38.230
Regarding your company's earlier presentation,

26:38.230 --> 26:39.690
we are leaning towards...

26:46.920 --> 26:47.850
I overheard a bit

26:48.400 --> 26:50.200
in the restroom just now.

26:50.920 --> 26:53.070
They said the scores are deadlocked.

26:56.220 --> 26:57.240
Then it depends on whether Mr. Xie

26:57.240 --> 26:59.040
is willing to pay for sentiment.

27:00.270 --> 27:00.750
Anyway,

27:00.750 --> 27:01.880
we've done our best.

27:01.920 --> 27:03.050
So don't be nervous.

27:04.350 --> 27:04.830
Right.

27:05.720 --> 27:06.240
Yes.

27:07.370 --> 27:09.700
No need to be nervous.
We can't be nervous.

27:11.120 --> 27:12.980
I need to go to the restroom again.

27:17.020 --> 27:18.520
Everyone, please return to the conference hall.

27:18.520 --> 27:20.120
The evaluation results are in.

27:20.120 --> 27:20.990
Let's go.

27:29.070 --> 27:30.840
They're here! They're back!

27:43.590 --> 27:44.350
How was it?

27:49.880 --> 27:50.790
This time,

27:50.790 --> 27:52.310
the schedule...

27:52.730 --> 27:54.050
was a bit tight.

27:58.290 --> 27:59.030
Revenge is a dish

27:59.030 --> 28:00.240
best served cold.

28:01.230 --> 28:04.290
There will definitely be other projects
in the future.

28:10.750 --> 28:11.400
What?

28:11.400 --> 28:12.530
Why are you smiling?

28:18.920 --> 28:20.230
Did we win?

28:29.160 --> 28:29.920
Ms. Zhou.

28:31.160 --> 28:32.110
I was just saying...

28:32.110 --> 28:34.030
Hu Xiu, you guys are so bad at acting!

28:34.030 --> 28:34.960
I couldn't help it!

28:34.960 --> 28:36.440
Can't you hold it in a little longer?

28:36.440 --> 28:36.720
I...

28:36.720 --> 28:39.110
One vote! We beat Zhuling by one vote!

28:40.830 --> 28:41.310
I knew it!

28:41.310 --> 28:43.310
You didn't reply to my messages! I was worried sick!

28:43.310 --> 28:45.640
I just wanted to give everyone a surprise.

28:45.640 --> 28:46.750
Everyone's been too tense lately.

28:46.750 --> 28:48.750
-Seriously!
-Just kidding. Relax.

28:51.590 --> 28:53.790
You need to improve your acting skills.

28:55.510 --> 28:56.960
I don't need much acting skill.

28:56.960 --> 28:59.000
As long as I can fool Commander Qin
in the game,

28:59.000 --> 28:59.860
that's enough.

29:06.920 --> 29:08.920
Is the design competition over yet?

29:09.910 --> 29:11.040
Without the star there,

29:11.040 --> 29:12.970
poor Mr. Gong is having a hard time.

29:14.490 --> 29:15.650
Everyone has worked hard.

29:15.650 --> 29:17.450
Today, go home and get some rest.

29:17.480 --> 29:19.030
Later we'll have a celebration banquet.

29:19.030 --> 29:19.830
It'll be on Mr. Xiao.

29:19.830 --> 29:20.640
How's that?

29:20.790 --> 29:22.920
Feel free to suggest any food you want.

29:43.160 --> 29:43.880
Honey!

29:49.510 --> 29:50.680
Why are you waiting outside?

29:50.680 --> 29:51.410
Are you cold?

29:51.550 --> 29:52.640
Look who's talking.

29:52.640 --> 29:54.840
You're late for your own class reunion.

29:55.110 --> 29:56.940
I stopped by our company after work.

29:56.940 --> 29:58.270
There were no parking spaces when I came here,

29:58.270 --> 29:59.670
so I had to park next door.

29:59.750 --> 30:00.640
You should just

30:00.640 --> 30:01.750
quit that job soon.

30:01.750 --> 30:02.310
I will.

30:02.650 --> 30:04.270
Let's wait until the company
is more stable.

30:04.270 --> 30:04.870
Over here.

30:06.270 --> 30:07.330
Come on, everyone.

30:07.350 --> 30:08.680
I'd like to make a toast.

30:09.480 --> 30:10.310
This glass,

30:10.790 --> 30:12.200
we have to finish it all.

30:12.350 --> 30:13.550
We're all in Shanghai,

30:13.550 --> 30:14.830
yet we haven't seen each other in so long.

30:14.830 --> 30:15.630
Is that right?

30:16.070 --> 30:16.790
There, there.

30:16.790 --> 30:18.480
Cheers!

30:18.480 --> 30:19.270
Cheers!

30:24.160 --> 30:24.830
All gone.

30:31.110 --> 30:31.830
Guangming,

30:31.960 --> 30:33.350
I have to say, you're still

30:33.350 --> 30:34.310
the most thoughtful.

30:34.310 --> 30:36.160
No wonder you were the campus heartthrob back then.

30:36.160 --> 30:37.220
Oh, give me a break.

30:37.310 --> 30:38.110
Back in the day,

30:38.110 --> 30:39.480
when we were in school,

30:39.750 --> 30:41.960
there were so many girls liked Guangming.

30:41.960 --> 30:42.750
Too bad

30:43.070 --> 30:44.200
you married young.

30:44.350 --> 30:45.820
You broke so many women's hearts.

30:45.820 --> 30:46.730
My fault.

30:47.920 --> 30:48.920
Alright, guy.

30:48.920 --> 30:50.070
We just sat down for a moment.

30:50.070 --> 30:51.200
Please, give me a break.

30:51.200 --> 30:52.240
Stop teasing me.

30:54.070 --> 30:54.680
Speaking of which,

30:54.680 --> 30:56.270
I just remembered something.

30:56.270 --> 30:56.880
Earlier,

30:57.000 --> 30:58.240
when we went to that conference,

30:58.240 --> 30:59.440
I ran into Chi Xin.

31:00.030 --> 31:00.720
Chi Xin?

31:00.830 --> 31:01.830
Do you remember her?

31:01.830 --> 31:02.960
That junior sister?

31:03.110 --> 31:04.000
I remember back then

31:04.000 --> 31:05.400
we once worked on a project as a team.

31:05.400 --> 31:06.440
She came to us on her own,

31:06.440 --> 31:07.770
asking to join our team.

31:08.270 --> 31:08.880
She's

31:08.880 --> 31:10.400
at Zhitung Tech now, I think.

31:10.400 --> 31:11.530
Pretty impressive.

31:12.400 --> 31:13.660
You're well informed.

31:14.030 --> 31:15.790
But you know what?
That day at the conference,

31:15.790 --> 31:17.550
Chi Xin specifically came over

31:18.030 --> 31:19.560
to add Guangming on WeChat.

31:21.030 --> 31:21.680
But,

31:22.270 --> 31:23.790
Guangming refused her immediately.

31:23.790 --> 31:24.400
Right.

31:24.680 --> 31:25.830
Later she came to me

31:25.890 --> 31:27.110
and asked me to give her his WeChat.

31:27.110 --> 31:27.750
And then?

31:28.300 --> 31:30.430
The man himself immediately refused.

31:30.920 --> 31:32.200
That's why Guangming

31:32.200 --> 31:33.720
is a model husband.

31:33.720 --> 31:35.030
How does that saying go?

31:35.030 --> 31:36.640
"Out of all the waters,

31:36.670 --> 31:37.930
I only take one scoop."

31:38.160 --> 31:39.710
"Passing through a thousand flowers..."

31:39.710 --> 31:41.680
"Not a petal touches me."

31:44.150 --> 31:46.010
How come I didn't know about this?

31:46.160 --> 31:48.050
No need to report such a trivial matter.

31:48.050 --> 31:48.770
Come on.

31:48.800 --> 31:50.000
Let me make another toast.

31:50.000 --> 31:52.160
A toast to our former campus heartthrob.

31:52.160 --> 31:52.680
Come on!

31:52.680 --> 31:53.240
Everyone!

31:53.240 --> 31:53.830
Come on.

31:53.830 --> 31:56.640
And to our youth we can't go back to!

31:57.070 --> 31:59.110
And to this model couple.

31:59.110 --> 32:00.200
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

32:00.200 --> 32:00.960
Cheers!

32:11.130 --> 32:11.860
What's this?

32:12.880 --> 32:13.590
What?

32:16.450 --> 32:17.820
When did you buy this?

32:25.170 --> 32:27.700
I noticed you're not in high spirits tonight.

32:28.010 --> 32:29.940
Is everything okay at the company?

32:32.550 --> 32:33.920
Do you remember that project

32:33.920 --> 32:35.400
I mentioned to you at home?

32:38.570 --> 32:40.700
The client's funding has been cut off.

32:40.750 --> 32:42.480
The project might be canceled.

32:44.530 --> 32:45.510
That project—

32:45.510 --> 32:46.960
didn't they just transfer
the first payment

32:46.960 --> 32:48.160
to your company?

32:48.310 --> 32:49.510
If it stops now,

32:49.890 --> 32:52.290
won't all the work you did before be in vain?

32:54.440 --> 32:56.640
So that's why you came back from Jinshan

32:56.860 --> 32:57.900
last time?

33:04.750 --> 33:05.440
Xiaorou,

33:05.790 --> 33:06.640
don't worry.

33:07.490 --> 33:09.180
I won't let this project fail.

33:10.590 --> 33:11.830
There's already a big company

33:11.830 --> 33:12.790
that's interested.

33:12.790 --> 33:14.190
We're still discussing.

33:15.730 --> 33:17.590
I'll definitely secure the deal.

33:21.270 --> 33:23.200
The cab is here. It's cold outside.

33:23.520 --> 33:24.360
Go back now.

33:26.140 --> 33:27.240
Tell the designated driver

33:27.240 --> 33:28.270
to drive slowly.

33:29.000 --> 33:30.170
Let me know when you get to the company.

33:30.170 --> 33:30.650
Okay.

33:31.090 --> 33:31.820
I'm leaving.

33:42.430 --> 33:42.990
Bye.

34:14.230 --> 34:15.290
This way, Mr. Xiao.

34:17.510 --> 34:19.480
You're in good spirits, Mr. Xiao.

34:24.630 --> 34:25.920
Winning the competition

34:25.920 --> 34:27.190
definitely calls for a drink

34:27.190 --> 34:28.110
in a nice place.

34:31.550 --> 34:32.230
Yeah.

34:33.040 --> 34:34.440
The drinks here are good.

34:35.020 --> 34:37.080
Perfect for drowning one's sorrows.

34:41.980 --> 34:42.860
You know,

34:43.840 --> 34:46.000
these years since you came back to China,

34:46.000 --> 34:48.130
you're really different from before.

34:49.780 --> 34:51.909
You're more and more like a true elite.

34:58.920 --> 35:00.850
Remember to keep your tail hidden.

35:01.510 --> 35:03.030
Don't let it show.

35:03.550 --> 35:04.760
This game

35:04.920 --> 35:06.360
is just getting started.

35:07.360 --> 35:09.960
You'll have to play along
with me until the end.

35:12.360 --> 35:14.560
A game that makes you go to such lengths—

35:15.500 --> 35:17.760
I'll certainly play along until the end.

35:19.230 --> 35:20.000
After all,

35:20.440 --> 35:22.760
seeing you so on edge

35:23.080 --> 35:25.340
is way more entertaining than drinking.

35:32.190 --> 35:32.710
Mr. Pei,

35:33.000 --> 35:34.210
let me take you to the VIP room

35:34.210 --> 35:36.670
to complete your membership registration.

35:36.760 --> 35:37.710
Forget it.

35:38.290 --> 35:40.420
You let just anyone in here, don't you?

35:49.430 --> 35:51.160
I heard about the competition.

35:51.620 --> 35:52.680
Congratulations.

35:53.040 --> 35:53.640
Thank you.

35:56.300 --> 35:56.780
Here.

35:58.960 --> 36:01.150
These are the personnel files from the steel factory back then.

36:01.150 --> 36:02.400
The director's secretary,

36:02.400 --> 36:03.070
finance staff,

36:03.070 --> 36:04.130
project managers—

36:04.400 --> 36:05.630
anyone with a name

36:05.630 --> 36:06.630
whose information could be found

36:06.630 --> 36:07.360
is here.

36:13.230 --> 36:13.840
Well?

36:14.070 --> 36:16.330
Is the one you're looking for among them?

36:18.480 --> 36:19.590
Besides these,

36:19.880 --> 36:21.080
have you found anyone

36:21.250 --> 36:23.040
who was closer to him?

36:26.150 --> 36:27.480
Now that you mention it,

36:28.000 --> 36:29.530
there actually is someone.

36:29.760 --> 36:31.630
This person is quite interesting.

36:31.630 --> 36:34.230
He was the director's personal driver
back then.

36:34.230 --> 36:35.710
It's said that after the director died,

36:35.710 --> 36:37.670
he managed to climb the social ladder,

36:37.670 --> 36:39.030
became a building materials supplier,

36:39.030 --> 36:40.560
and is now doing quite well.

36:41.800 --> 36:42.800
His driver?

36:45.190 --> 36:45.840
Yes.

37:03.990 --> 37:05.560
[Supply Records]

37:24.330 --> 37:26.000
He was such a nobody that it was hard

37:26.000 --> 37:27.370
to even find his name.

37:27.870 --> 37:29.870
But the connection he made back then

37:30.190 --> 37:31.790
is one you're familiar with.

37:31.800 --> 37:33.070
It's Zhuling Group.

38:41.350 --> 38:41.980
Dad,

38:42.880 --> 38:43.840
you're back.

38:58.280 --> 38:59.800
Why didn't you tell me?

39:00.380 --> 39:02.110
I could have come to pick you up.

39:06.450 --> 39:08.850
Don't you have anything
you want to tell me?

39:14.290 --> 39:15.890
How's your health recently?

39:18.110 --> 39:19.320
That determines

39:19.720 --> 39:21.030
how I should talk to you

39:21.510 --> 39:23.170
and how much I should tell you.

39:23.720 --> 39:25.000
You lost the competition,

39:25.000 --> 39:27.260
and you still dare to have this attitude?

39:27.920 --> 39:29.190
Look at Xiao Zhiyu.

39:29.510 --> 39:30.570
In just a few years,

39:30.800 --> 39:32.250
he's already climbed to a position

39:32.250 --> 39:34.330
the entire industry can't ignore.

39:37.550 --> 39:38.190
Dad,

39:41.000 --> 39:42.550
only those on the ground

39:43.780 --> 39:45.050
need to climb up.

39:46.680 --> 39:47.990
People like me

39:48.590 --> 39:49.960
just need to sit here

39:51.090 --> 39:53.220
and give them the motivation to climb.

39:56.590 --> 39:57.710
With you like this,

39:58.710 --> 40:00.590
how can I entrust Zhuling to you?

40:03.740 --> 40:05.200
Think about it carefully.

40:09.920 --> 40:11.180
There's another thing

40:12.480 --> 40:14.280
I need you to run an errand for me.

40:30.180 --> 40:30.840
Auntie Yue.

40:32.150 --> 40:32.840
Zhen.

40:33.030 --> 40:33.830
Take this soup

40:33.840 --> 40:34.950
and try it.

40:36.590 --> 40:37.800
Is this for my dad?

40:38.690 --> 40:39.800
I made a pot of this soup.

40:39.800 --> 40:41.040
There's more upstairs.

40:41.040 --> 40:43.100
I'll go get another bowl for your dad.

40:44.110 --> 40:44.880
Thank you.

41:10.670 --> 41:11.150
Mr. Pei,

41:11.150 --> 41:12.110
your coffee is ready.

41:12.110 --> 41:13.440
There are some new desserts we developed.

41:13.440 --> 41:14.370
Please try them.

41:16.280 --> 41:16.880
Thanks.

41:18.720 --> 41:19.430
And?

41:23.510 --> 41:24.110
Okay.

41:47.360 --> 41:49.280
Qin Xiaoyi?
